WEBVTT

NOTE Cloud Guardian, Why Choose Us. 30 seconds, 6 scenes.

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.020
Tuesday. Susan runs accounts payable. A client emails about an invoice.

2
00:05.020 --> 00:09.640
Their bank has changed. Pay the new account by Friday.

3
00:09.640 --> 00:14.260
Not the client. R N, not M. Six days old.

4
00:14.260 --> 00:19.938
Cloud Guardian blocked it in two seconds. Susan never saw it.

5
00:19.938 --> 00:24.958
Eighty four thousand stayed put. No claim. Susan keeps her job.

6
00:24.958 --> 00:30.000
Cloud Guardian. Twice the quality. Half the price.
